{"id":"wb-5-501","name":"余荫山房","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"余荫山房","text":"余荫山房，又名余荫园，位于中国广东省广州市番禺区南村镇罗边村北大街，为清代道光年间举人邬彬的私家花园，广东四大名园之一。1983年被列为广州市文物保护单位，1989年被列为广东省文物保护单位，2001年6月被公布为全国重点文物保护单位，2023年3月被评为国家4A级旅游景区。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BD%99%E8%8D%AB%E5%B1%B1%E6%88%BF","revisionId":93686876,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93686876","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/87eb2d540d6d69ca9989567d.jpg","title":"Guangzhou_Panyu_Yuyin_Shanfang_2012.11.19_16-11-37.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Guangzhou_Panyu_Yuyin_Shanfang_2012.11.19_16-11-37.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5e/Guangzhou_Panyu_Yuyin_Shanfang_2012.11.19_16-11-37.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"广州市番禺区南村镇余荫山房 --","width":320,"height":213}}